# gibwork-sync credentials.
#
# gibwork-sync NEVER loads this file implicitly. Load it explicitly:
#   node --env-file=.env $(which gibwork-sync) plan
#   bun --env-file=.env run src/index.ts plan
#
# Provide ONE of the two below. A raw private key is never accepted as a
# command-line argument, because arguments leak into shell history and into
# `ps` output for every other user on the machine.

# Option 1 — the key itself: base58, or a JSON array of 32/64 bytes.
GIBWORK_PRIVATE_KEY=

# Option 2 — a path to a Solana keypair JSON file (preferred).
# GIBWORK_KEYPAIR_PATH=/absolute/path/to/keypair.json

# Optional: set to 1 to enable the live stage test suite (spends stage funds).
# GIBWORK_LIVE_TEST=0
